:"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0112","start":112,"end":116,"surface":"襄城侯山","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0117","start":117,"end":120,"surface":"常山王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或稱號仍待逐處覆核，不補熟知名字。"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"呂王台","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000822","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0139","start":139,"end":142,"surface":"太子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000844","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"呂媭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000845","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"呂他","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000846","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0170","start":170,"end":173,"surface":"呂更始","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000847","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"呂忿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000848","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","book_id":"b-shiji-009","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p029","text":"朱虛侯已殺產，帝命謁者持節勞朱虛侯。朱虛侯欲奪節信，謁者不肯，朱虛侯則從與載，因節信馳走，斬長樂衛尉呂更始。還，馳入北軍，報太尉。太尉起，拜賀朱虛侯曰：「所患獨呂產，今已誅，天下定矣。」遂遣人分部悉捕諸呂男女，無少長皆斬之。辛酉，捕斬呂祿，而笞殺呂媭。使人誅燕王呂通，而廢魯王偃。壬戌，以帝太傅食其復為左丞相。戊辰，徙濟川王王梁，立趙幽王子遂為趙王。遣朱虛侯章以誅諸呂氏事告齊王，令罷兵。灌嬰兵亦罷滎陽而歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m029-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"朱虛侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000832","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m029-0005","st